ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=brazos
 countyarchery@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:brazoscountyarchery@gmail.com
CREATED:20200708T180308Z
DESCRIPTION:Can you believe it?  It's already time for our next club shoot 
 and monthly meeting.  This Thursday\, we will be meeting at the range at 6:
 30 for the meeting or you can join via WebEx by clicking the green JOIN but
 ton about 15 minutes before the meeting.\n\nIn June we awarded 4 scholarshi
 ps of $500 each to students attending secondary education.  Those letters w
 ill be going out soon.\n\nThe shoot will be on Sunday with a 9 am start for
  compound shooters and 8 am start for traditional shooters.  We ask that yo
 u keep group sizes small and follow all of the recommended safety protocols
 .\n\nWe realize it will be hot outside so we are making accommodations for 
 that.\n\nWe are looking forward to seeing everyone again!\n\nAs usual\, if 
 you have any questions or comments\, do not reply to this email but please 
 contact me at TraceySadler@hotmail.com or text/ call 979-219-0433.  You can
  also text Mark Owen at 979-220-6382.\n\nTracey\n\n________________________
 ________\nFrom: Tracey Sadler <tsadler@tamus.edu>\nSent: Wednesday\, July 8
