UID:56f8b2f0-42a0-480b-b97e-55c543c2f3bf
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=brazos
 countyarchery@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:brazoscountyarchery@gmail.com
CREATED:20200610T163442Z
DESCRIPTION:We are ramping up our 3D season and will be hosting our first m
 onthly shoot on Sunday!  Since we are following the ASA shoot times\, tradi
 tional shooters will start at 8 am and compound shooters will start at 9 am
 .  As usual\, our world-famous taco truck will be there\, too!\n\nWe are al
 so going to meet at Ikes Small Engine on South College in Bryan on Thursday
  for our regular monthly meeting OR you can join that meeting virtually by 
 logging in with the link below or calling in.\n\nMeeting time 6:30 - In per
 son - feel free to come early with some dinner.  Please maintain 6 feet of 
 separation or wear a mask.\n\nTo join virtually\, log in with the green JOI
 N MEETING button below or call in by dialing the 855 number below.  If call
 ing in you will need the access code provided above the green join meeting 
 button.\n\nIf you have any comments or questions\, please email me at Trace
 ySadler@hotmail.com or BrazosCountyArchery@gmail.com.  You may also call or
  text me at 979-219-0433\n\nSee you soon!\nTracey\n________________________
