DESCRIPTION:\nCharity Fundraiser for the Twin City Missions.  Entry fee is 
 a donation of canned goods.  Start time is 10am.  30 3D targets in hunting 
 type scenarios.  Full scoring rings of targets may be obscured.  Normal 8 a
 nd 10 ring point circles\, shots to body of animal are minus 5 points.  An 
 ethical pass on shooting a target is plus 1 points.\n\nCome on out and have
  some fun!  Hope to see everyone there!
